      "writtenOn": "2025-05-06T19:19:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is just caching the board id check. If the board id is in the list, monitor the PCR0 value and reset the EC in rec+dev.\n\nThe board id is only set once and it can\u0027t be changed. I think it\u0027s fine to cache it. I just don\u0027t want to put reading the board id in the boot path. It\u0027s  unnecessary to read it every time. We don\u0027t want to increase boot time.",
